flowchart TD
    Path["Pathogen<br/>(antigen)"]
    Innate["Innate Immunity<br/>(immediate)"]
    Phag["Phagocytes<br/>(neutrophils, macrophages)"]
    Inflam["Inflammation<br/>(cytokines)"]
    APC["Antigen-Presenting<br/>Cell (dendritic)"]
    Adapt["Adaptive Immunity<br/>(delayed, specific)"]
    TH["Helper T cell<br/>(CD4+)"]
    TC["Cytotoxic T cell<br/>(CD8+)"]
    B["B cell → Plasma cell"]
    Ab["Antibodies<br/>(humoral immunity)"]
    Mem["Memory cells<br/>(long-lived)"]
    Path -->|triggers| Innate
    Innate --> Phag
    Innate --> Inflam
    Phag -->|presents antigen| APC
    APC -->|activates| Adapt
    Adapt --> TH
    Adapt --> TC
    Adapt --> B
    TH -->|activates| B
    B -->|secretes| Ab
    TH --> Mem
    TC --> Mem
    B --> Mem